{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q96405266","formula":"C₂₉H₃₁N₇O₃","hill":"C29H31N7O3","elements":["H","C","N","O"],"composition":{"C":29.0,"H":31.0,"N":7.0,"O":3.0},"names":{"en":"Selpercatinib","ru":"Селперкатиниб"},"descriptions":{"en":"Selpercatinib, sold under the brand name Retevmo among others, is a targeted medication for the treatment of cancers in people whose tumors have an alteration (mutation or fusion) in a specific gene (RET which is short for \"rearranged during transfection\"). Before beginning treatment, the identification of a RET gene alteration must be determined using laboratory testing. Selpercatinib is taken by mouth.","ru":"Селперкатиниб, продаваемый под торговой маркой Ретевмо, — препарат, который применяется для лечения некоторых типов немелкоклеточного рака лёгких и рака щитовидной железы. Его используют в случаях, когда присутствует слияние или мутация гена RET. Селперкатиниб назначают после того, как другие терапии оказались неэффективными. Препарат принимают внутрь."},"fame":8,"pubchemCid":134436906,"mass":525.6,"charge":0,"smiles":"CC(C)(COC1=CN2C(=C(C=N2)C#N)C(=C1)C3=CN=C(C=C3)N4CC5CC(C4)N5CC6=CN=C(C=C6)OC)O","inchikey":"XIIOFHFUYBLOLW-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"6-(2-hydroxy-2-methylpropoxy)-4-[6-[6-[(6-methoxy-3-pyridinyl)methyl]-3,6-diazabicyclo[3.1.1]heptan-3-yl]-3-pyridinyl]pyrazolo[1,5-a]pyridine-3-carbonitrile","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"rdkit","ref":"134436906","atoms":70,"license":"Computed with RDKit from SMILES (PubChem, Wikidata)"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-7.989,"y":3.361,"z":1.667,"el":"C"},{"x":-6.636,"y":3.053,"z":2.31,"el":"C"},{"x":-6.729,"y":3.169,"z":3.83,"el":"C"},{"x":-6.117,"y":1.656,"z":1.912,"el":"C"},{"x":-6.001,"y":1.596,"z":0.478,"el":"O"},{"x":-5.612,"y":0.348,"z":0.06,"el":"C"},{"x":-6.467,"y":-0.551,"z":-0.44,"el":"C"},{"x":-5.99,"y":-1.7